    "ikame": "1)Zaviye — zāviye (ﺯﺍﻭﻳﻪ)\r\n2)Cephe — cebhe (ﺟﺒﻬﻪ)\r\n3)Veçhe — veche (ﻭﺟﻬﻪ)\r\n4)Cihet — cihet (ﺟﻬﺖ)\r\n5)Hasep — ḥaseb (ﺣﺴﺐ)\r\n6)Nokta-i nazar — noḳṭa-i naẓar (ﻧﻈﺮ ﻧﻘﻄﻪ)\r\n7)İnd — ‘ind (ﻋﻨﺪ)\r\n8)Ufuk — ufḳ (ﺍﻓﻖ)",
